CSMA mindmap module — attribution

The following files in this module are derived from mind-elixir-core:

  src/modules/mindmap/services/ConnectorGeometry.js
    Faithful ES-port of `src/utils/generateBranch.ts` (main() and sub()
    SVG path generators). Direction model (LHS / RHS / DOWN), quadratic
    and cubic Bézier control points, rounded-vertical orthogonal
    connector for top-down layout are preserved verbatim (modulo syntax).

  src/modules/mindmap/services/LayoutEngine.js
    Inspired by mind-elixir's tree-direction model (`LEFT | RIGHT | SIDE`
    constants, left/right balance assignment in `layout.ts`) but
    reimplemented as pure functions returning absolute rectangles. The
    upstream relies on CSS-driven positioning of `me-*` custom elements;
    no such function exists in mind-elixir to port verbatim. The
    direction assignment at the root and the `--node-gap-x` gap knob are
    preserved concepts.

Upstream commit at time of port: v5.15.0-beta.1.
